<Base title="Owen Medeiros — Technical Profile">
  <p>
    I'm an electrical engineer working on superconducting electronics. I'm
    currently a Technical Staff Scientist at MIT Lincoln Laboratory, where I
    develop superconducting electronics for quantum computing and advanced
    sensing applications.
  </p>
  <p>
    I completed my PhD in Electrical Engineering and Computer Science at MIT in
    2025, working in the Quantum Nanostructures and Nanofabrication Group with
    Professor Karl Berggren. My doctoral work developed
    <a href="https://hdl.handle.net/1721.1/164062">superconducting nanowire
    integrated circuits for scalable cryogenic memory</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site collects my <a href="/research">research and publications</a>,
    <a href="/projects">technical projects</a> — spanning superconducting
    device simulation, IoT sensor networks, data analysis, and VR development — and some
    <a href="/maths">mathematical visualizations</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Selected work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/research">A scalable superconducting nanowire memory array with
      row–column addressing</a> — <span class="pub-venue">Nature Electronics
      (2026)</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/research">A superconducting full-wave bridge rectifier</a> —
      <span class="pub-venue">Nature Electronics (2025)</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/tdgl-simulation">TDGL simulation</a> — tdgl3d, a fully
      3-D simulator for superconducting devices and circuits
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/soil-moisture">Soil moisture monitoring system</a> —
      distributed ESP8266 sensor network with InfluxDB and Grafana
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Live apps</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/tdgl/live/nbn-3d.html">Live NbN simulator</a> — a 3-D
      NbN detector block with bias current, field, heat and photon absorption,
      solved on your GPU in the browser (needs WebGL2). Part of the
      <a href="/projects/tdgl-simulation">TDGL simulation</a> project
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://grafana.owenmedeiros.com">grafana.owenmedeiros.com</a> —
      live dashboards for the <a href="/projects/soil-moisture">soil moisture
      monitoring system</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>
